{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的长句把多个情绪转折和判断放在同一屏，尤其S11、S12，扫读时不如X轻松，容易来不及抓住层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短标题更容易一眼扫过，但部分关键动机依赖小字补充，而且反复使用亲近、委屈等概括词，容易让不同阶段显得相似。Y把人物舍不得什么、为什么矛盾、为什么不回头以及最后如何选择，都放进了大字，观众即使不读小字，也更容易理解人物的心理和前后因果。Y的情绪变化更具体，尤其是短暂温暖、温暖消退、重新怀疑和最终接纳的层次，整体更细腻完整，因此我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78a5eb4a-05e3-447f-9478-08182ae5faa2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195509926861Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:56:20.641017+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a8fcd19f4f6572de496bd32a54841d47c168056bc729618b00b9edc5f791b4df", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme